  title: S6-C  RETRIEVABLE
  body: 'TAP left-click once, then more if needed (1 troop is enough). Press Z to
    target it and SWEEP to steer.

    EXPECT: the label turns blue and it is carried
    along a path to the green disc. At the disc it shows Placed.'
  radius: 3
