  body: 'Press 3 (Melee), press Z, HOLD left-click.

    EXPECT: it is clearly bigger
    than you. The number shows 5 and 5 troops fit around it without overlapping.
    It has 1500 HP (see the HEALTH box). It hits hard, so expect losses.'
  radius: 3
